#: kcmvim.cpp:126
msgid "Please don't choose a symlink, kvim or gvim are often symlinks to 'vim'."
msgstr ""
"Peidiwch â dewis cyswllt symbolaidd; yn aml cysylltau symbolaidd at 'vim' "
"ydi kvim neu gvim"

#: kcmvim.cpp:126 kcmvim.cpp:130
msgid "Invalid File"
msgstr "Ffeil Annilys"

#: kcmvim.cpp:130
msgid "The chosen file cannot be executed!"
msgstr "Methu rhedeg y ffeil sy wedi'i ddewis"

#: kcmvim.cpp:155
msgid ""
"KVim has been detected. DCOP support has been activated but it will only "
"work with KVim >= 6.1.141rc2. If you have an earlier version, please select "
"the X11 Communication system."
msgstr ""
"Canfuwyd KVim. Galluogwyd cefnogaeth DCOP ond dim ond efo KVim >"
"= 6.1.141rc2 fydd o'n gweithio. Os oes fersiwn cynharach gennych, dewiswch "
"cysawd Cyfathrebu X11."

#: kcmvim.cpp:166
msgid ""
"Your Vim cannot be used with the Vim KPart, it lacks the Client-Server "
"feature which is required to use a GUI Vim (except KVim)."
msgstr ""
"Ni ellir defnyddio eich Vim efo KPart Vim; mae o heb y nodwedd "
"Dibynnydd-Gweinydd sydd ei angen i ddefnyddio Vim GUI (heblaw am KVim)."

#: kcmvim.cpp:173
msgid ""
"Warning: Your Vim uses GNOME as a GUI; it should probably work with the Vim "
"KPart but it cannot be tested due to a bug in Vim's GNOME GUI.\n"
"You will therefore have to try it yourself. Choose X11 Communication and try "
"the component in Konqueror, for example. If it fails then you will have to "
"update your Vim's version."
msgstr ""
"Rhybudd: Defnyddia eich Vim chi GNOME fel GUI; dylai fo weithio, debyg, gyda "
"KPart Vim ond ni ellir ei brofi o achos nam yn GUI GNOME Vim.\n"
" Bydd rhaid ichi ei drio eich hun felly. Dewiswch Cyfathrebu X11 a cheisio'r "
"gydran yn Konqueror, er enghraifft. Os bydd o'n methu bydd rhaid ichi "
"ddiweddaru fersiwn eich Vim."

#: kcmvim.cpp:180
msgid ""
"Your Vim cannot be used with the Vim KPart; it lacks the Client-Server "
"feature which is required for GTK/GNOME support."
msgstr ""
"Ni ellir defnyddio eich Vim efo KPart Vim; mae o heb y nodwedd "
"Dibynnydd-Gweinydd sydd ei angen i gefnogi GTK/GNOME."

#: kcmvim.cpp:184
msgid "No GUI supported"
msgstr "Does yna'r un GUI wedi'i gefnogi"

#: kcmvim.cpp:186
msgid ""
"Your Vim does not provide any GUI support. A GUI is required to use this "
"component. Upgrade your Vim's version or install GVim/KVim."
msgstr ""
"Ni ddarperir eich Vim gefnogaeth GUI. Mae angen GUI i ddefnyddio'r gydran "
"hon. Diweddarwch fersiwn eich Vim neu gosodwch GVim/KVim."

#: kcmvim.cpp:192
msgid ""
"\n"
"Your Vim lacks the Eval feature; it is highly recommended to have this "
"feature enabled. You may encounter problems without it."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Mae eich Vim heb y nodwedd Eval; mae galluogi'r nodwedd hon wedi'i "
"gymeradwyo'n gryf. Gallwch ddod ar draws problemau hebddi."

#: kcmvim.cpp:194
msgid ""
"Test Successful\n"
msgstr ""
"Prawf Lwyddiannus\n"

#: kcmvim.cpp:194 kcmvim.cpp:196
msgid "Vim Component Test"
msgstr "Prawf Gydrannau Vim"

#: kcmvim.cpp:196
msgid ""
"Test Failed!\n"
msgstr ""
"Methwyd y Prawf!\n"

#: rc.cpp:2
#, no-c-format
msgid "Vim Embedding Configuration"
msgstr "Ffurfweddu Mewnadeiladu Vim"

#: rc.cpp:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "General Configuration"
msgstr "Ffurfweddu Cyffredinol"

#: rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To be able to use Vim inside KDE, you need a GUI-enabled Vim (like gvim or "
"kvim) version 6.x. According to the 'vim' you choose, this configuration "
"panel will adjust some settings automatically for you. \n"
"On the first tab (just below), you can choose some general options. On the "
"second tab you have to specify the full path to your vim executable and to "
"'test' it.\n"
"During the test, the best settings for your Vim will be detected. You are "
"free to change them afterwards but it may lead to broken configurations."
msgstr ""
"Er mwyn defnyddio Vim tu fewn i KDE, mae angen arnoch Vim GUI-alluog (fel "
"gvim neu kvim) fersiwn 6.x. Yn ôl y vim y dewiswch chi, bydd y panel "
"ffurfweddu yma'n addasu rhai gosodiadau'n ymysgogol ichi. \n"
" Ar y tab cyntaf (union isod), cewch ddewis rhai dewisiadau cyffredinol. Ar "
"yr ail dab rhaid ichi benodi'r llwybr i'ch rhaglen vim ac i'w 'phrofi'.\n"
" Yn ystod y prawf, darganfyddir y gosodiadau gorau ar gyfer eich Vim. Croeso "
"ichi eu newid wedyn ond mi all hynny arwain at gam-ffurfweddiad."

